XScavenger: the keys
====================

The game starts in demo mode, playing on its own.

  F1 or Space     play from the first level not yet solved
  F4              play from level 1
  F8              the next demo level
  F2              the animator (draw your own graphics)
  F3              the level editor
  F10             choose your own movement keys
  F5 (menu)       your player name
  Alt + X         leave the game

Playing:

  Cursor keys     run, climb ladders, hang from bars
  Ctrl            dig a hole to the left
  Alt             dig a hole to the right
  K or Shift      lose a life (when trapped)
  Keypad + and -  the next and the last level
  Pause           pause
  Esc             back to the demo

The levels you have solved, your keys and name are kept in the drawer's
User drawer. The drawer's DOC-Scavenger.txt has the editor and animator
keys.
